09 at 11 54 27\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/18498568-3770-42ba-8135-e4d23f67a0b3\" />\r\n\r\n4.5 beta 3 - FPS: 315, draw calls 980\r\nthis PR - FPS: 2080, draw calls 15\r\n\r\n### 4. BBCode demo:\r\n<img width=\"1064\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-07-09 at 11 55 05\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5e0c749d-2cb9-4cad-af0d-6d0132185c89\" />\r\n\r\n4.5 beta 3 - FPS: 145, draw calls 45\r\nthis PR - FPS: 145, draw calls 23\r\n(FPS seems to be linited by constant redraws of the RTL, not number draw calls)\r\n\r\n### 5. 500 random Labels with outline.\r\n<img width=\"612\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-07-09 at 12 01 11\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e7900751-15a8-4c12-a2fd-7cab7b0ba418\" />\r\n\r\n4.5 beta 3 - FPS: 380, draw calls 1000\r\nthis PR - FPS: 380, draw calls 1000\r\n(can't be batched, labels are different canvas items and have specific draw order)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3051804681/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3536181984","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108369#issuecomment-3536181984","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108369","id":3536181984,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Sxdrg","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo